{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-isa-9-1","title":"Isaiah 9:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 What joy shall be in the midst of afflictions, by the birth and kingdom of Christ. 8 The judgments upon Israel for their pride, 13 for their hypocrisy, 18 and for their impenitency.</p>\n<p>A.M. 3264. B.C. 740. the dimness. 8:22 when. 1Ki 15:19,20; 2Ki 15:29; 2Ch 16:4 afterward. Le 26:24,28; 2Ki 17:5,6; 1Ch 5:26 by the way. Mt 4:15 Galilee of the nations. or, Galilee the populous.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-9-2","title":"Isaiah 9:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>walked. 50:10; 60:1-3,19; Mic 7:8,9; Mt 4:16; Lu 1:78,79; 2:32; Joh 8:12 Joh 12:35,46; Eph 5:8,13,14; 1Pe 2:9; 1Jo 1:5-7 in the land. Job 10:21; Ps 23:4; 107:10,14; Am 5:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-9-3","title":"Isaiah 9:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>hast multiplied. 26:15; 49:20-22; Ne 9:23; Ps 107:38; Ho 4:7; Zec 2:11; 8:23; 10:8 not increased the joy. or, to him increased the joy. theyjoy. 12:1; 25:9; 35:2,10; 54:1; 55:12; 61:7,10; 65:18; 66:10; Ps 4:7 Ps 126:5,6; Jer 31:7,12-14; Ac 8:8; Php 4:4; 1Pe 1:8 according. 16:9,10 and as men. Jud 5:3; 1Sa 30:16; 2Ch 20:25-28; Ps 119:162; Lu 11:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-9-4","title":"Isaiah 9:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>For thou hast broken. or, When thou brakest. 14:25; 47:6; Ge 27:40; Le 26:13; Jer 30:8; Na 1:13 the staff. 10:5,27; 14:3-5; 30:31,32; Ps 125:3 as in the day. 10:26; Jud 6:1-6; 7:22-25; 8:10-12; Ps 83:9-11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-9-5","title":"Isaiah 9:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>For every battle, etc. or, When the whole battle of thewarrior was, etc. confused noise. 13:4; 1Sa 14:19; Jer 47:3; Joe 2:5; Na 3:2 but this shall be. or, and it was, etc. burning. 4:4; 10:16,17; 30:33; 37:36; 66:15,16; Ps 46:9; Eze 39:8-10 Mal 3:2,3; Mt 3:11; Ac 2:3,19; 2Th 1:8 fuel. Heb. meat. Le 3:11,16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-9-6","title":"Isaiah 9:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>For unto. 7:14; Lu 1:35; 2:11 unto us a son. Joh 1:14; 3:16,17; Ro 8:32; 1Jo 4:10-14 the government. 22:21,22; Ps 2:6-12; 110:1-4; Jer 23:5,6; Zec 6:12,13; 9:9,10 Mt 11:27; 28:18; 1Co 15:25; Eph 1:21,22; Re 19:16 his name. 7:14; Jud 13:18; *marg: Jer 31:22; Mt 1:23; 1Ti 3:16 Counsellor. 28:29; Zec 6:13; Lu 21:15; Joh 1:16; 1Co 1:30; Col 2:3 The mighty God. 45:24,25; Ps 45:3,6; 50:1; Jer 23:5,6; Joh 1:1,2; Ac 20:28; Ro 9:5 Tit 2:13; Heb 1:8; 1Jo 5:20 The everlasting Father. 8:18; 53:10; Pr 8:23; Heb 2:13,14 The Prince of Peace. 11:6-9; 53:5; Ps 72:3,7; 85:10; Da 9:24,25; Mic 5:4,5; Lu 2:14 Joh 14:27; Ac 10:36; Ro 5:1-10; 2Co 5:19; Eph 2:14-18; Col 1:20,21 Heb 7:2,3; 13:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-9-7","title":"Isaiah 9:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>the increase. 2Sa 7:16; Ps 2:8; 72:8-11; 89:35-37; Jer 33:15-21; Da 2:35,44 Da 7:14,27; Lu 1:32,33; 1Co 15:24-28 to establish it. 11:3-5; 32:1,2; Ps 45:4-6; 72:1-3,7; Heb 1:8; Re 19:11 The zeal. 37:32; 59:16,17; 63:4-6; 2Ki 19:31; Eze 36:21-23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-9-8","title":"Isaiah 9:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>sent a word. 7:7,8; 8:4-8; Mic 1:1-9; Zec 1:6; 5:1-4; Mt 24:35</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-9-9","title":"Isaiah 9:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>And all. 26:11; 1Ki 22:25; Job 21:19,20; Jer 32:24; 44:28,29; Eze 7:9,27 Eze 30:19; 33:33 even Ephraim. 7:9; 10:9-11 in the pride. 46:12; 48:4; Pr 16:18; Mal 3:13; 4:1; 1Pe 5:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-9-10","title":"Isaiah 9:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>bricks. 1Ki 7:9-12; 10:27; Mal 1:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-9-11","title":"Isaiah 9:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>set up. 8:4-7; 10:9-11; 17:1-5; 2Ki 15:29; 16:9 join. Heb. mingle.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-9-12","title":"Isaiah 9:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>Syrians. 2Ki 16:6; 2Ch 28:18; Jer 35:11 devour Israel. De 31:17; Ps 79:7; 129:3-6; Jer 10:25 open mouth. Heb. whole mouth. For all. 17,21; 5:25; 10:4; Jer 4:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-9-13","title":"Isaiah 9:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>the people. 1:5; 26:11; 57:17; 2Ch 28:22; Job 36:13; Jer 5:3; 31:18-20 Eze 24:13; Ho 5:15; 7:10,16 neither. 31:1; De 4:29; Jer 29:11; 50:4,5; Ho 3:4,5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-9-14","title":"Isaiah 9:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>will cut. 3:2,3; 19:15; 2Ki 17:6-20; Ho 1:4,6,9; 4:5; 5:12-14; 8:8; 9:11-17 Ho 13:3; Am 2:14-16; 3:12; 5:2,3; 6:11; 7:8,9,17; 9:1-9; Mic 1:6-8 in one day. 10:17; 30:13; Ho 10:15; Re 18:8,10,17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-9-15","title":"Isaiah 9:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>ancient. 3:5; 5:13; 1Sa 9:6 the prophet. 28:17; 29:10; 1Ki 13:18; 22:22-24; Jer 5:31; 14:14,15 Jer 23:9,14,15,25-27; 27:9,10,14,15; 28:15,16; 29:21,22 Eze 13:1-16,19,22; Ho 9:8; Mal 2:9; Mt 7:15; 24:24; 2Co 11:13-15 Ga 1:8,9; 2Th 2:9-12; 2Ti 4:2,3; 2Pe 2:1-3; 1Jo 4:1; Re 19:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-9-16","title":"Isaiah 9:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>the leaders, etc. or, they that call them blessed. 3:12; Mt 15:14; 23:16-36 led of them. or, called blessed of them. Nu 6:23-26; 1Ki 8:55,56; 2Ch 30:27; Heb 7:7 destroyed. Heb. swallowed up.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-9-17","title":"Isaiah 9:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>have no joy. 10:2; 13:18; 27:11; 62:5; 65:19; Ps 147:10; Jer 18:21; Zec 9:17 for every. 10:6; Job 15:34; Jer 5:1; Mic 7:2; Mt 16:3 every mouth. 32:6,7; Mt 12:34 folly. or, villany. For all. 12,21; 5:25; 10:4; Eze 20:33</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-9-18","title":"Isaiah 9:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>wickedness. 1:31; 30:30,33; 33:12; 34:8-10; 66:16,17; Nu 11:1-3; De 32:22 Job 31:11,12; Am 7:4; Na 1:6,10; Mal 4:1; Mt 13:49,50; 25:41 Mr 9:43-50 it shall. 10:16-18; 27:4; Heb 6:8 shall kindle. Eze 20:47,48 mount. 5:24; Ps 37:20; Ho 13:3; Joe 2:20; Re 14:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-9-19","title":"Isaiah 9:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>is the land. 5:30; 8:22; 24:11,12; 60:2; Jer 13:16; Joe 2:2; Am 5:18; Mt 27:45 Ac 2:20 fuel. Heb. meat. 5 no man. 13:18; Eze 9:5; Mic 7:2,6; 2Pe 2:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-9-20","title":"Isaiah 9:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>And he. 49:26; Le 26:26-29; Jer 19:9; La 4:10 snatch. Heb. cut.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-9-21","title":"Isaiah 9:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>Ephraim. Jud 7:2; 1Sa 14:20; 2Ki 15:30; 2Ch 28:6-8; Mt 24:10; Ga 5:15 For all this. 12,17; 5:25; 10:4; Jer 4:8</p>"}]}